{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y个别段落的感受词和解释铺得过满，尤其S06、S07、S11附近会比X多出一些较强的心理判断，瞬间会抢掉主线一点注意力。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y从上到下顺着读，【加亮词】让我扫屏时不用完整读完每句也能抓住“靠近—怕需要太多—试着放开—又怕失去—最后不再藏”的推进；感受又多数贴在相应句子附近或到音乐节点才出现，所以比较容易知道这一刻为什么会变。X的主线其实很完整，但左右来回扫时，右边大量同时存在的短词常常不知道该挂到哪一句上，细节因此更像一团气氛；Y虽然偶尔偏满，却更能把音乐里的具体触感和前后心理变化连成同一件事。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d609185-357e-4f1e-82bf-4e274e8513b6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T213848282800Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:39:03.288245+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "224b2d1b3936f6a30b2830874410399a7cb4984e54906fb8f7161d0fb3e149cf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a737